{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56524","headline":"还丹口诀 · 彭真君","name":"还丹口诀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴阳造化不须传，只用水银是黑铅。\n不伤汞，不伤铅，此物道中玄复玄。\n世人识得真龙虎，成道只在片时间。\n（《不还丹照监》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"彭真君","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56524.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56524","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}